{
  "id": "reversing-watchpoints-hwbp",
  "workdir": "/home/student/task",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/task/answer.txt",
    "contains": "counter=8"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/task.md",
      "text": "# Задача: отследить изменение переменной\n\nWatchpoint (аппаратная точка на данные) срабатывает при записи в память.\nОтследи глобальную `counter` в функции `bump()`.\n\n1. `gdb -batch -ex 'break main' -ex 'run' -ex 'watch counter' -ex 'continue' -ex 'continue' -ex 'continue' -ex 'continue' watchme`\n2. gdb печатает Old/New value на каждой записи.\n3. Найди **последнее** значение `counter`.\n\nЗапиши в `answer.txt` строку вида `counter=<число>` и набери `check`.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/watchme",
      "b64": "",
      "mode": "755"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "gdb": {
      "help": "gdb -batch -ex ... <файл> — отладчик (вывод реального gdb)",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "watch",
          "example": "gdb -batch -ex 'watch counter' -ex 'continue' watchme",
          "output": "Breakpoint 1 at 0x4010e3: file watchme.c, line 6.\n\nBreakpoint 1, main () at watchme.c:6\n6\tlong main(void){ bump(); bump(); put(\"done\\n\"); return 0; }\nHardware watchpoint 2: counter\n\nHardware watchpoint 2: counter\n\nOld value = 0\nNew value = 7\nbump () at watchme.c:5\n5\tvoid bump(void){ counter += 7; counter ^= 3; }\n\nHardware watchpoint 2: counter\n\nOld value = 7\nNew value = 4\nbump () at watchme.c:5\n5\tvoid bump(void){ counter += 7; counter ^= 3; }\n\nHardware watchpoint 2: counter\n\nOld value = 4\nNew value = 11\nbump () at watchme.c:5\n5\tvoid bump(void){ counter += 7; counter ^= 3; }\n\nHardware watchpoint 2: counter\n\nOld value = 11\nNew value = 8\nbump () at watchme.c:5\n5\tvoid bump(void){ counter += 7; counter ^= 3; }\n"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "gdb: используй watch counter (см. подсказку).\n"
    }
  }
}
